      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are zero matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $Z$ is *not* a zero matrix since some of its entries are not zeros (for instance, $z_{11}=10\\ne 0$).\n\n- $Q$ is *not* a zero matrix since some of its entries are not zeros (for instance, $q_{14}=1\\ne 0$).\n\n- $F$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\nTherefore, only $F$ is a zero matrix.",
